        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e889def7-7861-5766-9283-f880f88e8fad",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk, Lever Brothers, Margarine Unie, Unilever\n- Places: Indonesia, Angke, Jakarta\n\nFacts:\n- In 1930, Lever Brothers merged with Margarine Unie to form Unilever.\n- On December 5, 1933, PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk was established in Indonesia as Lever Zeepfabrieken N.V.\n- PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk was established as a subsidiary of Lever Brothers.\n- PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk initially operated a soap factory at Angke, Jakarta.",
